 *
 * 用法：
 *   wn_kmod_read cpu     [/dev/weaknet_cpu_stat]  [--count N] [--interval SEC]
 *   wn_kmod_read softirq [/dev/weaknet_softirq]   [--count N] [--interval SEC]
